# Mid-chat queue

If the user sends another message **while you are mid-code**:

1. Finish the current coherent slice (do not drop half-done edits).
2. Then handle the new / queued request.

Do not abandon in-flight work to start a conflicting rewrite. Detail: `memory-bank/mid-chat-queue.md`.
